            <div xml:id="m-04fd60c6-48a0-4116-8386-c9525a0de02a">
              <lg xml:id="m-d2e106f0-f677-4708-8d06-34fd27a38c38">
                <l xml:id="m-551ff00a-5c65-44d1-b0fd-5b2201ba5bf3" facs="#m-9b0225da-ba97-4faf-9136-601678f4b46d" label="text-like">The Solemn evening Mass</l><l xml:id="m-bb81eb2f-f14a-46d7-840f-2e254a613c8c" facs="#m-73c1cbc0-aa4e-425e-aefb-8451ed282e1b" label="ambiguous">677</l><l xml:id="m-0b845280-5fc3-4bb3-a6b0-73250434422a" facs="#m-fb18380a-033e-4f2e-a333-b6379319d91d" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobíscum.</l><l xml:id="m-a6d418d5-30a3-45a6-b1a1-ab1b13caffc3" facs="#m-41cdcc5d-a8d6-47ca-b49e-86e2312ab1ad" label="lyrics-like">F. Et cum spiritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-a19fd8e8-cd83-4b76-9d9d-6b01a9ed69cd" facs="#m-9a1ae100-1b69-443b-a9f5-8c70b89c14c4" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-f6025b77-33f4-4bd2-b0b3-ac0533eb8da1" facs="#m-8982c511-39b6-43ae-ba3c-027fb9ed2753" label="text-like">Prayer</l><l xml:id="m-82f805e9-dbfb-4ff8-bff2-9884b6cad3ce" facs="#m-9f8f792c-a00f-4d9c-95af-7d76bf8f3257" label="lyrics-like">HDésto, Dómine, quaésumus,</l><l xml:id="m-116ce00c-4b0c-42b9-96ab-2a3328f281e6" facs="#m-ac46a4c9-1400-442a-b7c9-597f0b691ee3" label="lyrics-like">rióra abluúntur inquinaménta;t</l><l xml:id="m-a7470eaa-6a47-45f4-a08b-05ca6e0702f3" facs="#m-dce40701-6305-48de-bd57-45dd3f438ded" label="lyrics-like">Il officio servitútis nostrae:</l><l xml:id="m-9a4462cf-a8e4-413b-b547-7b4db06f5c2c" facs="#m-6a08a793-32bc-4c36-85c5-89946a53f1e9" label="lyrics-like">sic a te ómnium nostrum interióra</l><l xml:id="m-0a6ba046-1a3b-4671-84dd-6e02662f3100" facs="#m-45bc8093-df32-4f7c-8786-fcb24e40fd32" label="ambiguous">et quia tu discipulis tuis pedes</l><l xml:id="m-0e2dbdec-87bf-4340-9480-b03f2f9dd5b7" facs="#m-b79aa61f-3424-4de1-88f2-e47d9c8618b8" label="lyrics-like">lavéntur peccáta. Quod ipse</l><l xml:id="m-7881e606-2409-4576-adca-9e91042f9b23" facs="#m-726e611d-ffb1-46b0-94cf-ca4e2846eff7" label="lyrics-like">laváre dignátus es, ne despícias</l><l xml:id="m-dc50cac6-5614-49fa-be22-af143d116f7a" facs="#m-1ea87920-62d7-409f-acd3-b732a2789d00" label="lyrics-like">praestáre dignéris, qui vivis et</l><l xml:id="m-eb689435-fc4d-4eae-8fc3-e6bcae055c41" facs="#m-52344ac9-186b-4d5f-b965-9bd680fef372" label="lyrics-like">ópera mánuum tuárum, quae</l><l xml:id="m-993c67de-f76c-42f1-af16-fdb4eb40145e" facs="#m-a30da694-c495-4c0d-a0c5-3e8cd97638e6" label="lyrics-like">regnas Deus:* per ómnia saécula</l><l xml:id="m-7bfbffc6-7ac6-4693-9ad5-8b426af565a4" facs="#m-1e0e4ecc-2151-44e8-b771-81a365f4bac6" label="lyrics-like">nobis retinénda mandásti : "ut,</l><l xml:id="m-c0014391-96c7-4f1f-b8f0-9a7a613f3484" facs="#m-e66f85a5-0cea-4f65-96ca-c73cb026780f" label="lyrics-like">saeculórum. W. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-cea120da-09a2-464d-a737-939616642ac2" facs="#m-a16c32a8-ebdd-4f27-9985-b99ddf693338" label="ambiguous">sicut hic nobis et a nobis exte¬</l><l xml:id="m-27df8034-763a-423c-bcbd-d9c60932b9b9" facs="#m-4f4e62be-cc8d-4b2d-973f-a7f062c2e5a6" label="text-like">After the prayer, the toelve men, first genuflecting to the altar and bouing</l><l xml:id="m-31e12a7f-4bcb-4717-a23a-39eaa4220167" facs="#m-a0ed3e62-a09d-485b-a3f0-a0ba1b696a2e" label="text-like">to the celebrant, are conducted back to their places, either in choir, if they</l><l xml:id="m-217d56a3-9670-45f6-b725-d5c11b1b68e1" facs="#m-6896fe5b-8c9b-4252-a45f-ac13a914c5f0" label="text-like">are clergv, or to the special places assigned them, if laity.</l><l xml:id="m-9b707a75-1a79-4d0f-bdb9-f0bdf0b0d300" facs="#m-dd3d92a2-a6d0-45af-9257-d5c891bd19ea" label="text-like">21. Where the feet-washing takes place apart from the solemn Mass, the</l><l xml:id="m-f77689bb-b5f8-47a6-a0ec-d892de6f0ae0" facs="#m-09506b14-a21d-4d5e-9fdd-37fcf55a3c25" label="text-like">same rite is folloued as above; but beginning with the singing of the Gospel</l><l xml:id="m-3547f925-24a3-4dab-b3fc-98fa3328e252" facs="#m-adc1834f-3bd1-4b6a-98c8-9bc70ff6d373" label="text-like">Ante diem festum Paschæ with the usual ceremonies. The celebrant wears</l><l xml:id="m-9fcb9dca-3d32-47f3-9db0-86b1082e3541" facs="#m-af388f4f-b1db-4c1d-be44-56b3e26f6148" label="ambiguous">a white cope.</l><l xml:id="m-ade08d41-0596-4d6e-ab3d-b695c0441390" facs="#m-27bae0bc-3a54-44f7-aee7-f88a28a08778" label="text-like">22. After the washing of the feet (or, where it does not take place, after</l><l xml:id="m-57aa99e5-778d-46b6-b752-db10996293fc" facs="#m-390d7de9-07bb-41e2-8a14-09bd63717b05" label="text-like">the sermon) me Mass is continued in the usual way.</l><l xml:id="m-d7eb8958-0062-4c8d-a8b0-4f946b995a5c" facs="#m-b66cbe3d-312e-4f9e-8ac4-33207bbe4114" label="text-like">FROM THE OFFERTORY TO THE END</l><l xml:id="m-1ee8b872-a41e-4662-a468-0e04c712fcd5" facs="#m-abb1abaf-0833-42f7-8c9d-66176eb91499" label="text-like">OFFERTORY ANTIPHON</l><l xml:id="m-c34090f8-c577-47d0-ae6a-97b4adff40a2" facs="#m-677c7768-95bb-4f1c-bca4-b08ae4af6db7" label="ambiguous">2</l><l xml:id="m-50639f7d-5962-436b-badb-820673d1fe67" facs="#m-5ebe3dac-6c58-43f6-addd-b02e8e6f5914" label="ambiguous">D Exte- ra</l><l xml:id="m-0f3d5af3-6721-485b-8ce5-ab80e84a4747" facs="#m-7c00e54d-40de-4216-b392-99d30e84967e" label="lyrics-like">Dómi- ni “fé- cit vir¬ tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-87929692-2568-4bca-b4f3-2093e709fcbe" facs="#m-ba3839a4-3cc9-470c-9b86-f949beb72cb0" label="ambiguous">vit me: non</l><l xml:id="m-79bc04e6-f222-46cf-ae84-599e2d672884" facs="#m-6d5d92da-5f20-447d-924c-b486d408f090" label="lyrics-like">exaltá¬</l><l xml:id="m-5d890390-7518-4989-ab4c-a0b726a18600" facs="#m-e67763bf-0296-41ac-929c-87a7fadd57b0" label="lyrics-like">tem, déxte-ra Dó-mi-ni</l><l xml:id="m-8c8caf36-bdc0-4715-826b-41fbdbccab05" facs="#m-d9dbeff5-be8a-4b11-ad0c-191a11faa031" label="lyrics-like">et narrábo ó-pe-ra</l><l xml:id="m-2ce6fd69-126a-4e22-a62b-c38fd9cf42df" facs="#m-5319ce8c-567f-470f-a9f6-9b51b826681c" label="lyrics-like">mó-ri- ar, sed vi-vam,</l><l xml:id="m-29be052b-cf9b-4814-8645-fe63e1ef7d63" facs="#m-3817ddee-ce96-4534-a962-74ebb7f8edc3" label="lyrics-like">Dómi-ni</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>